ercycle -> Hovercycles, Skycycles & Rocket Bikes; Motorcycle -> Motorcycles & Snowmobiles; per-skill bonuses are a note. Technical +10% on Lore only, a note. Cowboy, Electrical, Military, Rogue, Science none. SECONDARY: four, plus one at levels 3, 8 and 13. || EQUIPMENT: fishing spears (2D6 S.D.C.) have no catalog row and are mapped to wooden-spear x3 with the printed damage in the note (judgement). Energy rifle or pistol of choice (typically L-20) as a choice led by l-20-pulse-rifle. 100 feet of rope as rope (per 40 ft) x3. Personal tent as tent-one-man; mosquito netting as the per-square-yard row; mallet as small-mallet; medium Mega-Damage armor as personalized-light-or-medium-mdc-body-armor (judgement; no generic medium row). Personal items not stored. || MONEY: 2D6x1,000 in Universal Credits or tradable goods (fishbone carvings, stones, furs)."
